  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-088-xueandu:p001",
      "text": "薛安都，河東汾陰人也。世為強族，同姓有三千家。父廣為宗豪，高祖定關、河，以為上黨太守。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-songshu-088-xueandu:p001:m0000",
