          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "23q_wcp_hny_A",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "同父、同軍主、同赴薛安都一事，與崔道固傳景微暫作同一人；兩處字形分存。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0007",
